    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR6t0288-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p6.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">This is precisely *huí xīn* (回心, turning the mind),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p6.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">*míng xīn* (明心, clarifying the mind).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p7.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">Vaulting over the wall and entering the mountain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p7.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">is leaving one *yī xīn* (一心, one mind) and entering another *yī xīn* (一心, one mind).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p8.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">What one enters in the mountains</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p8.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">is thinking about the unthinkable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p9.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">What the world abandons</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p9.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">is non-thinking.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p10.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">To have gathered this into the eyes, two or three *hú* (斛, a unit of dry measure),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p10.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">to have played with this in the *yè shí* (業識, karma consciousness) in myriad ways.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">In learning the Way like this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">reward naturally comes from merit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">Although merit has not yet been achieved from reward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">secretly borrowing the nostrils of the Buddhas and Ancestors to exhale,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">and seizing the hooves of donkeys to give approval,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">is indeed the model for all time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p1.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">For a moment, mountains, rivers, the great earth, the sun, the moon, and the stars,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p1.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">all are the mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p2.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">At just this very moment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p2.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">what kind of guarantee manifests itself?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p3.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">To say "mountains, rivers, and the great earth,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p3.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">mountains and rivers are, for example, mountains and water.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p3.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">The great earth is not limited to this place alone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p4.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">There should also be many mountains;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p4.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">there are great *Xūmí* (須彌, Sumeru) and small *Xūmí* (須彌, Sumeru).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p5.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">Some are situated horizontally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p5.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">some are situated vertically.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p6.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">There are three thousand worlds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p6.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">there are countless lands.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p7.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">Some are attached to form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p7.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">some are attached to emptiness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p8.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">There should also be many rivers;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p8.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">there is the celestial river,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p8.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">there is the terrestrial river.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p6.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">To clarify.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p7.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">To clarify the great path of Dharma-nature by following scriptures and knowledge is considered</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p7.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">to clarify Dharma-nature oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p8.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">Scriptures</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p8.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">are Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p8.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">are oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p9.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">Knowledge</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p9.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">is Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p9.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">is oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p10.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">Dharma-nature</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p10.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">is knowledge,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p10.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">Dharma-nature</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p10.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">is oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p11.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">Because Dharma-nature is oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p11.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">it is not the self devised by heretics and demons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p12.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">In Dharma-nature, there are no heretics or demons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p12.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">only *chī zhōu lái* (喫粥來, eating congee coming),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p12.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">*chī fàn lái* (喫飯來, eating rice coming),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p12.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">and *diǎn chá lái* (點茶來, serving tea coming).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p1.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">However,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p1.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">those who call themselves long-time students of thirty or twenty years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p1.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">when they see or hear talk of Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p1.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">spend their lives in a daze.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">Those who call themselves satiated with monasteries,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">those who ascend to crooked wooden beds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">when they hear the voice of Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">when they see the color of Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">body and mind, environment and self,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">constantly ascend and descend in the usual cave of confusion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">Their way of thinking is:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">after the three realms and ten directions that we now see and hear are completely destroyed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">then Dharma-nature will further reveal itself;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">that Dharma-nature</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-18T15:31:00.947+09:00">is not the myriad phenomena that now exist—so they devise wrongly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p10.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">At this time, generally speaking,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p10.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">there is a turning of the *Fǎhuá* [Lotus Sutra]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p10.s5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">that makes beings into the three kinds of grasses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p10.s7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">and there is also a turning of the *Fǎhuá*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p10.s9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">that makes them into the two kinds of trees.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p11.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">It is not something to be awaited as 'having awareness' (*yǒujué*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p11.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">nor something to be doubted as 'lacking awareness' (*wújué*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p12.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">When it turns of itself and brings forth *bodhi*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p12.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">that is the south (*nánfāng*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p13.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">This attainment of the Way (*chéngdào*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p13.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">is from the very beginning Vulture Peak (*Língshān*) assembling in the south;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p13.s5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">Vulture Peak (*Língshān*) is invariably the turning of the *Fǎhuá*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p14.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">There are the Buddha-lands of the ten directions (*shífāng fótǔ*) assembling in empty space;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p14.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">these are the emanation bodies (*fēnshēn*) of the turning of the *Fǎhuá*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p15.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">When it already turns the *Fǎhuá* with the Buddha-lands of the ten directions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p15.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">there is no place for a single speck of dust (*yī wēichén*) to enter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p16.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">There is a turning of the *Fǎhuá* that is 'form is precisely emptiness' (*sè jí shì kōng*);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p16.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">it is not a matter of 'whether they retreat or depart' (*ruò tuì ruò chū*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p17.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">There is a turning of the *Fǎhuá* that is 'emptiness is precisely form' (*kōng jí shì sè*);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p17.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">it must be that 'there is no birth and death' (*wú yǒu shēngsǐ*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p18.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">It should not be called 'being in the world' (*zàishì*);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p18.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">is it then only 'extinction' (*mièdù*)?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p19.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">Those who are close friends (*qīnyǒu*) to me,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p19.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">I am also a close friend to them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p20.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">The dutiful courtesy (*lǐqín*) of a close friend,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p20.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">because it must not be forgotten,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p20.s5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">the jewel in the topknot (*jìzhū*) is bestowed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p20.s7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">and the time and season (*shíjié*) when the jewel in the robe (*yīzhū*) is bestowed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p20.s9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">must be thoroughly and completely investigated (*jiūjìn*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p21.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">There is a turning of the *Fǎhuá* where a jeweled stupa (*bǎotǎ*) appears before the Buddha;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p21.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">its height is five hundred *yojanas* (*yóuxún*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p22.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">There is a turning of the *Fǎhuá* where a Buddha is seated inside the stupa;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p22.s3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">his measure is two hundred and fifty *yojanas* (*yóuxún*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_S03-17.p23.s1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2025-11-14T10:41:37.48+09:00">Welling up from the earth (*cóng dì yǒng chū*),</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
</TEI>